        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">53 Onaylı Pratik Çözüm</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Tekil 999 ₺</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
